[Moriguchi 1990: p. 110]

yad uktaṃ bhagavatā

	āgataḥ kulaputraś ced bhaktyā saugatāsane /
	ādau triśaraṇaṃ deyaṃ bodhicittam anantaram // 1 //

	tataḥ śikṣāpadaṃ pañcapoṣdhādisamanvitam /
	daśākuśalaparityāgaṃ dattvā kuryād upāsakam // 2 //

iti asyānupūrviyām ucyate.
tatrādau gurumaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā anena krameṇa.

	oṃ vaṃ vajrodake hūṃ svāhā.

iti jalaśodhanam.

	yathā hi jātamātreṇa snāpitāḥ sarvatathāgatāḥ /
	tathāhaṃ snāpayiṣyāmi śuddhaṃ divyena vāriṇā // 3 //

	oṃ sarvatathāgatābhiṣekasamayaśriye hūṃ.

anena snānam.

	oṃ hrīḥ svāha.

hastapādaprakṣālanācamanamantraḥ.

	namo bhagavate puṣpaketurājāya tathāgatārhate samyaksaṃbuddhāya
	tad yathā oṃ puṣpe puṣpe mahāpuṣpe supuṣpe supuṣpodbhave
	puṣpasaṃbhave puṣpāvakīrṇe svāhā.

iti puṣpaśodhanam.

	oṃ vajrabhūme hūṃ phaṭ svāhā.

anena bhūśodhanam.

	dānaṃ gomayam ambunā ca sahitaṃ śīlaṃ ca saṃmārjanaṃ 
	kṣāntiḥ kuntapipīlikān apanayanaṃ vīryaṃ kriyotthāpanam /

[p. 112]

	dhyānaṃ tatkṣaṇam ekacittakaraṇaṃ prajñāsurekhojjvalā
	etāḥ pāramitāḥ ṣaḍ eva labhate kṛtvā muner maṇḍalam // 4 //

	bhavati kanakavarṇaḥ sarvarogair vimuktaḥ
	suramanujaviśiṣṭaś candravaddīptakāntiḥ /
	dhanakanakasamṛddhe jāyate rājavaṃśe
	sugatavaragṛhe 'smin kāyakarmāṇi kṛtvā // 5 //

iti maṇḍalīkaraṇam.

	oṃ surekhe vajrarekhe adhitiṣṭhantu sarvatathāgatāḥ svāhā.

anena maṇḍalamadhye 'ṣṭadalakamalaṃ likhet.

	oṃ candrārkavimale svāhā.

anena maṇḍalamadhye puṣpaṃ ekaṃ dadyāt.

	oṃ āḥ hūṃ.

anena kāyavākcittādhiṣṭhānaṃ vāratrayaṃ kuryāt.

	oṃ maṇidhari vajriṇi mahāpratisare rakṣa rakṣa māṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā.

anena puṣpam ekaṃ śirasi dadyāt.

	oṃ āsanavajre hūṃ.

anenāsane puṣpam ekaṃ dadyāt.

	oṃ suṃ sumerave namaḥ.

anena maṇḍalamadhye puṣpam ekaṃ dadyāt.

	oṃ hūṃ ūrdhvaṃ merave namaḥ.
	oṃ hūṃ madhye merave namaḥ.
	oṃ haḥ adho merave namaḥ.

anena meror ūrdhvamadhyādhaḥ puṣpadānam.

	oṃ yaṃ pūrvavidehāya namaḥ.

anena sumeroḥ pūrve puṣpaṃ dātavyam.

[p. 114]

	oṃ raṃ jambudvīpāya namaḥ.

dakṣiṇe.

	oṃ laṃ aparagodānīya namaḥ.

paścime.

	oṃ vaṃ uttarakurave namaḥ.

uttare.

	oṃ yāḥ upadvīpāya namaḥ.
	oṃ rāḥ upadvīpāya namaḥ.
	oṃ lāḥ upadvīpāya namaḥ.
	oṃ vā upadvīpāya namaḥ.

anenāgneyādikoṇeṣu puṣpaṃ deyam.

	oṃ yaṃ gajaratnāya namaḥ.
	oṃ raṃ aśvaratnāya namaḥ.
	oṃ laṃ puruṣaratnāya namaḥ.
	oṃ vaṃ strīratnāya namaḥ.

pūrvavidehādigarbheṣu pus.paṃ dātavyam.

	oṃ yāḥ cakraratnāya namaḥ.
	oṃ rāḥ khadgaratnāya namaḥ.
	oṃ lāḥ maṇiratnāya namaḥ.
	oṃ vāḥ sarvanidhānebhyo namaḥ.

agneyādikoṇagarbheṣu puṣpaṃ deyam.

	oṃ āḥ vajragurave idaṃ vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīccha hūṃ svāhā.

anena madhyamerau kūṭāgārodare viśvābjacandropari guruṃ vajrasattvaṃ dhyātvā puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ śirasi dātavyam.

	oṃ āḥ vajragurave vajradhūpe hūṃ.
	oṃ āḥ vajragurave vajradīpe hūṃ.
	oṃ āḥ vajragurave vajragandhe hūṃ.
	oṃ āḥ vajragurave vajranaivedye hūṃ.

aparo 'pi kiñcit tat sarvam anena krameṇa deyam iti.
punaḥ puṣpāñjalim ādāya

	namo buddhāya gurave namo dharmāya tāyine /
	namaḥ saṃghāya mahate gribhyo 'pi satataṃ namaḥ // 6 //

[p. 116]

	ratnatrayaṃ me śaraṇaṃ sarvaṃ pratidiśāmy agham /
	anumode jagatpuṇyaṃ buddhabodhau dadhe manaḥ // 7 //

	ābodhau śaraṇaṃ yāmi buddhaṃ dharmaṃ gaṇottamam /
	bodhau cittaṃ karomy eṣaḥ svaparārthaprasiddhaye // 8 //

	utpādayāmi varabodhicittaṃ nimantrayāmi ahuḥ sarvasattvān /
	iṣṭāṃ cariṣye varabodhicārikāṃ buddho bhaveyaṃ jagato hitāya // 9 //

	deśanāṃ sarvapāpānāṃ puṇyānāṃ cānumodanam /
	kṛtvopavāsaṃ cariṣyāmi āryāṣṭāṅgikapoṣadham // 10 //

ity anayā gāthayā ratnatrayarūpinaṃ guruṃ stuvayāt.
tato

	niryātayāmi bhāvena saṃpūrṇaratnamaṇḍalam /
	gurubhbyo bodhisattvebhyaś ca jagatsarvajñatāptaye // 11 //

	aṣṭaśṛṅgamayaṃ merudvīpopadvīpaśobhitam /
	aṣṭaratnasamayāyuktaṃ dadāmy anuttaradāyine // 12 //

iti niryāyet.

	yasya prasādakiraṇaiḥ sphuritātmatattvaratnaprabhāparkaraprahatāndhakārāḥ /
	paśyanty anāviladṛśāḥ savilāsam uccais
	tasmai namaskṛtir iyaṃ gurubhāskarāya // 13 //

iti puṣpaṃ prakṣipya namaskāraṃ kuryāt.

iti gurumaṇḍalam.



tato dānaṃ gomayagāthāpāṭhapūrvakaṃ trīṇi maṇḍalāni kuryāt.
tatra vairocanaratnasaṃbhavāmitābhāmoghasiddhiparivṛtākṣobhyanāyakaṃ maṇḍalaṃ buddhamaṇḍalam.
kriyācaryāyogayoginītantraparivṛtayoginīniruttaratantranāyakaṃ dharmamaṇḍalam.
maitreyagagaṇagañjasamantabhadravajrapāṇimañjughoṣasarvanivaraṇaviṣkambhikṣitigarbhajñānottaraparivṛtalokeśvaranāyakaṃ saṃghamaṇḍalam.
eṣu triṣu maṇḍaleṣu pūrvādidakṣiṇāvartena oṃkārādi namaḥśabdam antare prakṣipya pratyekaṃ svanāmoccāraṇapūrvakaṃ maṇḍale puṣpaṃ dātavyam.
evaṃ uktakrameṇa maṇḍalacatuṣṭayaṃ kṛtvā śrāddheṇa kulaputreṇa kuladuhitrā vā śubhe tithivāramuhūrtādau śuci vāśucivastraprāvṛttena manojñapradeśe tahtāgatādipratimāṃ prapūjya tad agre yathā vibhavataḥ puṣpādidānapuraḥsaraṃ ratnatrayaṃ praṇamya tathā yathāśakti prapūjya dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā kṛpālor vijñasya guroḥ puṣpāñjalipuraḥsaraṃ pādayor nipatya bhūgatajānumaṇḍalenotkuṭukena vā kṛtāñjalinā sthitvā trir evam adhyeṣaṇīyam.

	prayaccha me kalyāṇamitra atyayadeśanāpūrvakaṃ trīṇi śaraṇagamanāni bodhicittopādaṃ ceti.

tato guruṇādhyāśayapravṛttaṃ śiṣyam ālokya yathāśakti prayacchāmītisvīkārapuraḥsaraṃ evaṃ dātavyam.

	vada tvam āyuṣman.

[p. 120]

	samanvāharantu māṃ daśadiglokadhātusannipatitā buddhā bhagavanto mahābodhisattvāś ca samanvāharantv ācāryāham evaṃnāmā yat kiṃcit kāyavāgmanobbhir buddhabodhisattvān mātāpitārau.
tadanyān vā sattvān samāgamya iha janmani tadanyeṣu vā janmāntareṣu mayā pāpakaṃ karmakṛtaṃ kāritaṃ vānumoditaṃ vā tat sarvam ekadhyam abhisaṃkṣipya pi.ḍayitvā tulayitvā sarvabuddhabodhisattvānām ācāryasya cāntike agrayā pravarayā deśanayā pratideśayāmi.
	jñānaṃ smaran na praticchādayāmi.

trir evam.

	so 'ham evaṃnāmā evaṃ deśitātyayaḥ.
	imaṃ divasam upādāya yāvad ābodhimaṇḍaniṣadanād buddhaṃ bhagavantaṃ mahākāruṇikaṃ sarvajñaṃ sarvadarśinaṃ sarvavairabhayātītaṃ mahāpuruṣam abhedyakāyam anuttarakāyaṃ dharmakāyaṃ śaraṇaṃ gacchāmi dvipādānām agryam.

	so 'ham evaṃnāmā evaṃ deśitātyayaḥ.
	imaṃ divasam upādāya yāvad ābodhimaṇḍaniṣadanād dharmaṃ śaraṇaṃ gacchāmy anuttaraṃ mahāyānaṃ dharmāṃāṃ pravaram.

	so 'ham evaṃnāmā evaṃ deśityayaḥ.
	imaṃ divasam upādāya yāvad ābodhimaṇḍaniṣadanād avaivartikabodhisattvasaṃghaṃ śaraṇaṃ gacchāmi āntaṃ gaṇānāṃ śreṣṭham.


trir evam.

	so 'ham evaṃnāmā evaṃ deśitātyayaḥ.
	imaṃ divasam upādāya triśaraṇagato 'nantarasattvadhātūttāraṇāyābhyuddharaṇāparasaṃsāraduḥkhāt paritrāṇāya sarvajñāne pratiṣṭhāpanāya (-->122) yathātītānāgatapratyutpannā buddhā bhagavanto mahābodhisattvāś ca bodhicittam utpādya buddhatvam adhigatavanto 'dhigacchanti adhigamiṣyanti ca.
	yathā te sarvasaṃbuddhā anāvaraṇena buddhajñānena buddhacakṣuṣā paśyanti.
	yathā dharmāṇāṃ dharmatāṃ jñātvābhyanujānanti.
	tena vidhinā aham evaṃ nāmācāryasyāntikāt sarvabuddhabodhisattvānāṃ ca prato 'nuttarāyāṃ samyaksaṃbodahu cittam utpādayāmi.

trir evam.

	adyāgreṇa bodhisattvā māṃ sarvabuddhabodhisattvā ācāryaś ca dārayatu.

iti ratnatrayaśaraṇagamanaṃ bodhicittotpādapūrvakam.

paśaśikṣāpadagrahaṇam upāsakasaṃvaraṃ sa cādhyeṣitavate śiṣyāya evaṃ dātavyam.

	vada tvam āyuṣman.

	samanvāhara ācārya yathā te āryārhanto yāvajjīvaṃ prāṇātipātaṃ prahāya prāṇātipātāt prativiratāḥ, evam evāham amukanāmā imaṃ divasam upādāya yāvajjīvaṃ prāṇātipātaṃ prahāya prāṇātipātāt prativiramāmi.
	anenāhaṃ prathamenāṅgena teṣām āryāṇām arhatāṃ śikṣāyām anuśikṣe 'nuvidhīye anukaromi.

punar again.

	samanvāhara ācārya yathā te āryārhanto yāvajjīvam adattādānaṃ kāmamithyācāraṃ mṛṣāvādaṃ surāmaireyamadyapramādasthānaṃ ca prahāya, adattādānāt kāmamithyācārāt mṛṣāvādāt surāmaireyamadyapramādasthānāc ca prativiratāḥ.

[p. 124]

	tathāham amukanāmā imaṃ divasam upādāya yāvajjīvam adattādānam kāmamithyāvādaṃ mṛṣāvādaṃ surāmaireyamadyapramādasthānaṃ ca prahāya adattādānāt kāmamithyācārāt mṛṣāvādāt surāmaireyamadyapramādasthānāc ca prativiramāmi.
	anenāhaṃ pañcameṇāṅgena teṣāṃ āryāṇāṃ arhatāṃ śikṣāyām anuśikṣe anuvidhīye anukaromi.
	upāsakaṃ ca māṃ ācāryo dhārayatu.

evaṃ dvir api trir api.

adyāryāṣṭāṅgikapoṣadhaṃ kartum icchati tadā pūrvavad adhyeṣitavate śiṣyāya trīṇiśaraṇagamanāni dattvā aṣṭau śikṣāpadāny evaṃ dātavyāni.

	vada tvam āyuṣman

	samanvāhara ācārya aham amukanāmā imāṃ velām pādāya yāvac ca rātrigāminī yāvac ca śvaḥ sūryodayo 'grāntarāḥ sarvaprāṇibadhāt parasvaharaṇād abrahmacaryāt tathā vāgbhedād anṛtān madopajananāt pānād vikālāsanād mālāvarṇakanṛtyagītalalitāt śayanāsanād ucchritād adyāhaṃ virataḥ karomy arhatāṃ vṛttaṃ guṇair aṣṭabhiḥ.

trir evam.

	idaṃ me poṣadhaśīlasaṃvarasamādānaṃ cittālaṃkārāya citttapariṣkārāya sarvasattvānuttarajñānaphalāptaya iti.


tato guruṇā vaktavyam aupayikaṃ śiṣyeṇa sādhv iti.

	puṣṇāti yasmāt kuśalaṃ samagraṃ 
	kṛtaṃ ca saṃśodhayatīha pāpam /
	atopoṣaṇāc cittaviśodhanāc ca 
	tathāgataḥ poṣadham iti uvāca // 14 //

iti poṣadhavidhiḥ.
ayam eva saṃvaragāmin iti.

[p. 126]

tato rajomaṇḍale maṇḍalāntare vā prāguktavidhinā prathamaṃ kalaśādhivāsananyāsapañcopacārādipūjāḥ kṛtvā śiṣyān suparīkṣitān mānādidoṣarahitān upāsakādiśikṣāsuśrutādibhiḥ parikarmitān bhaktān vajrasattvasaṃvaragrahaṇayogyān kulaguṇarūparahitān apy adhvivāsayet.
yadi te śraddhayā vajrasattvasaṃvareṇātyantam arthiṇo vajrayāne 'nanyaśāstṛkā bhaveyuḥ.
tad uktaṃ bhagavatā sārdhatriṃśatikāyām.

	virūpāṃ nirguṇāṃś cāpi hīnān apy adhivāsayet /
	caturṇām apy anujñātaḥ parṣadāṃ maṇḍale vidhiḥ /
	śiktāsu svāsu yuktānāṃ mahāyānaratnātmanām // 15 //

iti.
yuktānāṃ tatparāṇām.
mahāyānaratātmanām iti anena manaskarmapradhānatām asya yānasya darśayaty avirodhārtham.

prakṛtisāvadye 'pi hi karmaṇi samutthānaviśeṣād anāpattir bhagavatā bahuśaḥ prakāśitāḥ.
tathā ca

	caṇḍāraveṇukārādy āmaraṇārthārthacintakāḥ /
	te 'pi hevajramārgasya sidhyante nātra saṃśayaḥ // 16 //

api ca

	nāpattiḥ śubhacittasya snehāc caiva dayāvataḥ /
	niṣiddham apy anujñātaṃ kṛpālor arthadarśinaḥ // 17 //

iti.

[p. 128]

yaḥ punar upacitapuṇyabahuśrutādiḥ sarvadharmān māyāsvapnasamānaśūnyataikarasān sudṛḍham adhimuñcati.
tasya bhikṣuvajradharasaṃvarayoḥ kva virodhagandho 'pi.

ata evoktaṃ bhagavatā  bhikṣuṃ vajradharaṃ kuryād ity avaśyañ caitad abhyupeyam.
katham itarathā samakālam ubhayor vāsanāprabodhāt svapnaṃ paśyan bhikṣur anubhavanasukhaṃ tatsaṃyogasukhāyāṃ svapnaṃ paśyantyāṃ bāhyāṅgadvīndriyasukhaparyantam anubhavann apy anāpattika iti vinaye pratipāditaṃ samādhātavyam.

yadi punar durjanagocaraḥ pradeśaḥ syāt tadā tasyāpi jñānamudrayā guhyaprajñājñānābhiṣekau dātavyau.
durjanāsaṃbhave tu karmamudrayaiva.
adṛḍhatattvāvimokṣasya tu bhikṣoḥ śrāddhasyāpi bāhyaprajñayābhiṣekagrahaṇaṃ niṣiddham.
anyathā pūrvasaṃvarabhraṃśān mahān anarthaḥ syāt.

yadi punar guruḥ sthirabhāvako bhavati tadā tenārpitāyāṃ jñānajudrāyāṃ tasyāpi prajñābhiṣeko deyo gṛhanatas ca nābrahmacaryaśaṅkāpi kāyakarmābhāvāt.
tasya tu prāggṛhasthāvasthāyām anubhūtasukhasya smaraṇenānandādibhedaḥ pratipādayitavyaḥ.

guror api sati bhikṣutve guhyābhiṣekādidāne sarvam uktam anusaṃdheyaṃ ity alam atiprasaṅgena prakṛtam ucyate.

tad anu śiṣyānukṛtamaṇḍalakān gṛhītapuṣpāñjalīn pṛthivyām āropitajānūn mantranayabhavyān nehaloka evābhyudayārthaṃ nāpi paralokābhyudayāyaya kiṃ tu tathāgatakāyatrayasaṃpatprāptaye maṇḍalapraveśaḥ (-->p.130) kāryaḥ tathā saty abhyudayadvayaṃ satsyatīty anuśrāvya tān śiṣyān dhiyā svaśarīre mukhena praveśya svavajranirgatān svapratibhāni vidyāpadmasthān hṛdbījakiraṇākṛṣṭari mukhena praviṣṭaiḥ savidyātathāgatair dravībhūtair abhikṣiktān dhyātvā maṇḍalasya pūrvadvāre upaveśya praveśaṃ yācayet.

	mrtyujanmajarānakramakarādibhayānakāt /
	bhavābdher ekauddhartā tvaṃ me śāstā mahārataḥ // 18 //

	icchāmy ahaṃ mahānātha mahābodhinayaṃ dṛḍham /
	dehi me samayatattvaṃ bodhicittaṃ ca dehi me // 19 //

	buddhaṃ dharmaṃ ca saṃghaṃ ca dehi me śaraṇaṃ trayam //
	praveśayasva māṃ nātha mahāmokṣapuraṃ varam // 20 //

iti pāṭhayan.

tad anu śiṣyam ekaṃ pradhānīkṛtya

	ehi vatsa mahāyānaṃ mantracaryānayaṃ vidhim /
	deśayiṣyāmi te samyagbhājanas tvaṃ mahānaye // 21 //

	buddhās triyadhvasaṃbhūtāḥ kāyavākcittavarjinaḥ /
	saṃprāptā jñānam atulaṃ vajramantraprabhāvanaiḥ // 22 //

	mantraprayogam atulaṃ yena bhagnaṃ mahābalam /
	mārasainyaṃ mahāghoraṃ śākyasiṃhādibhir balaiḥ // 23 //

	lokānuvṛttim āgamya cakraṃ pravṛtya nirvṛtāḥ /
	tasmān matim imāṃ vatsa kuru sarvajñatāptaye // 24 //

iti svayaṃ pāṭhitvā tato

[p. 132]

	ratnatrayaṃ me śaraṇaṃ sarvaṃ pratidiṣāmy agham /
	anumode jagatpuṇyaṃ buddhabodhau dadhe manaḥ // 25 //

iti triḥ pāṭhayet.
evaṃ sāmānyasaṃvariṇam ācāryasaṃvaraṃ grāhayitum

	cakre avaivartyasatsekaṃ dattvā nātha vadasva me /
	cakradevatayos tattvam ācāryaparikarma ca // 26 //

	samayaṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ saṃvaraṃ guhyam uttamam /
	ācāryaḥ syām ahaṃ nityaṃ sarvasattvāarthakāraṇāt // 27 //

iti viśeṣato 'dhyeṣaṇāṃ kārayitvā bodhicittopādaṃ kārayet.


[ Moriguchi (I-2), p. 14]

	samanvāharantu māṃ sarvabuddhabodhisattvāḥ.
	samanvāharatv ācāryo 'ham amukanāmā imāṃ velām upādāya
	ā bodhimaṇḍaniṣadanād utpādayāmi paramaṃ bodhicittam anuttaram /
	yathā traiyadhvikā nāthāḥ saṃbodhau kṛtaniścayāḥ // 28 //

	trividhāṃ śīlaśikṣāṃ ca kuśalaṃ dharmasaṃgraham /
	sattvārthakriyāśīlaṃ ca pratigṛhṇāmy ahaṃ dṛḍham // 29 //

	buddhaṃ dharmaṃ ca saṃghaṃ triratnāgram anuttaram /
	adyāgreṇa grahīṣyāmi saṃvaraṃ buddhayogajam // 30 //

	vajraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ ca mudrāṃ ca pratigṛhṇāmi tattvataḥ //
	ācāryaṃ ca grahīṣyāmi mahāvajrakuloccaye // 31 //

	caturdānaṃ pradāṣyāmi ṣaṭ kṛtvā tu dine dine /
	mahāratnakule yogye samaye ca manorame // 32 //

	saddharmaṃ pratigṛhṇāmi bāhyaṃ guhyaṃ triyānikam /
	mahāpadmakule śuddhe mahābodhisamudhave // 33 //

	saṃvaraṃ sarvasaṃyuktaṃ pratigṛhṇāmi sarvataḥ /
	pūjākarma yathāśaktyā mahākarmakuloccaye // 34 //

	utpādayāmi paramaṃ bodhicittam anuttaram /
	gṛhītvā saṃvaraṃ kṛtsnaṃ sarvasattvārthakāraṇāt // 35 //

	atīrṇāṃs tārayiṣyāmy amuktān mocayāmy aham /
	anāśvastān āśvāsayiṣyāmi sattvān sthāpayiṣyāmi nirvṛtau // 36 //

ity vāratrayaṃ pāṭhayitvā

[p. 16]

tad anv amṛtakuṇḍalimantreṇārakṣya teṣāṃ hṛtkaṇṭhaśiraḥsu vajrapadmacakropari sūryasūryacandrasthāni kṛṣṇaraktaśuklāni hūṃ āḥ oṃ ity akṣarāṇi cintayitvā tāny ucārayan hṛtkaṇṭhaśirāṃsi gandhodakayuktavajreṇa savyamuṣṭinā saṃspṛśya śirasi puṣpam agrato dhūpaṃ dīpaṃ ca hṛdaye punar gandhaṃ dadyāt.

tato śvatthādidantākāṣṭhaṃ dvādaśāṅgulam ṛjuniṣkītam apātitaṃ nirvraṇaṃ sugandhajalakṣālitam agrabaddhapuṣpaṃ śiṣyebhyo dadyāt.

te ca caturhaste caturasramaṇḍale gomayādilipte prāṅmukhodagmukhā vā taṃ dantakāṣṭham

	oṃ vajrahāsa hūṃ

iti pathitvāgreṇa khāditvāpāṭitam ūrdhvam avalokayanto nirapekṣam adhimukhaṃ kṣipanti.
teṣāṃ dantakāṣṭhapātānusāreṇa bhāvinīṃ siddhiṃ kathayet.
prāgudakpratyavavāgūrdhvādhomukhapātena śāntipuṣitvaśyābhicāravidyādharapātālaśiddhayo yathākramaṃ maṇḍalabahiḥ pāte tv asiddhir iti.

tad anu vaṃkārajaṃ tena japtajalam ācamanāya dattvā kuṇḍalinā vā saptajaptagandhāmbuculukatrayam

	oṃ hrīḥ viśuddhadharma sarvapāpāni cāsya viśodhaya sarvavikalpān apanaya hūṃ

iti paṭhan pāyayet.

tato bahis tān upaveśya hūṃjān tajjaptān kuṇḍalijaptān vā bahūn kuśān akṣatāgrān āstaraṇopadhānārtham

	oṃ vajratīkṣṇa vaṃ

iti mantreṇa dadyāt.

[p. 18]

tad anu kumārīkartitasūtram śiṣyāśarīrapramāṇaṃ triguṇitam amṛtakuṇḍalimantreṇa trigranthīkṛtaṃ teṣāṃ savyabāhau strīṇāṃ vāve

	oṃ buddhamaitrī rakṣa rakṣa sarvān svāhā

iti paṭhan svayaṃ baddhvā samyaksaṃrakṣotsāhayet.

	anekakalpakoṭibhir yat kṛtaṃ pāpakaṃ purā /
	tatsarvaṃ hi kṣayaṃ yāti dṛṣṭvā maṇḍalam īdṛśam // 37 //

	utsannā durgatis teṣāṃ sarvaduḥkhasya saṃbhavā /
	yeṣāṃ caryavare hy asmin matir atyantanirmalā // 38 //

	adya yuṣmābhir atulā lābhā labdhā mahātmabhiḥ /
	yena yūyaṃ jinaiḥ sarvaiḥ saputrair iha śāsane // 39 //

	sarve parigṛhītāsthajāyamānā mahātmabhiḥ /
	tena yūyaṃ mahāyāne sujātā hi bhaviṣyatha // 40 //

	eṣa mārgavaraḥ śrīmān mahāyānamahodayaḥ /
	yena yūyaṃ gamiṣyanto bhaviṣyatha tathāgatāḥ // 41 //

iti śrāvayitvā tad anu kuṇḍaimantreṇārakṣya tajjapārthaṃ kuṇḍalimantraṃ kathayitvā

	yat kiñcit svapnaṃ paśyatha tat sarvam prātar me kathayiṣyatha.

iti abhidhāya tān maṇḍalagṛhodare yavanikādy antarite anyatra vā siṃhaśayyayā svāpayet.
svayaṃ ca maṇḍalagṛhaṃ praviśya rakṣārthaṃ kuṇḍalimantraṃ japet.
iha yaḥ saṃvara ācāryam akartum api dīyate sa sāmanyaḥ śaraṇagamanabodhicittotpādamātralakṣanaḥ.
yat tv ācāryaṃ kartuṃ dīyate sa ācāryasaṃvaraḥ pañcakulasaṃgṛhītaḥ.

[p. 20]

ato 'yaṃ saṃvaradvayadānapūrvakaḥ śiṣyādhivāsanavidhiḥ.



tad anu guruḥ pratyūṣe baliṃ dattvā maṇḍalagṛhān niṣkramya śiṣyān svapnaṃ pṛṣṭvā giripātādisūcitāśubhasvapne kuṇḍalimantreṇārakṣya punar maṇḍalagṛhapraveśakāle śiṣyaiḥ

	oṃ praviśa bhagavan mahāsukhamokṣapuraṃ sarvasiddhisukhapradaṃ paramasukhottama sidhya jaḥ hūṃ vāṃ hoḥ prasidhyasva

ity utsāhitaḥ san

	tato vyutthāya yogīśaḥ protphullanayanojvalaḥ /
	kṛtvā pradakṣiṇaṃ cakraṃ dvārodghāṭanam ārabhet // 42 //

	paścimadvārataḥ sthitvā pratyālīḍhapadollasan /
	paṭhan pūrvahare dvāraṃ vajrahūṃkāramudrayā // 43 //

	oṃ vajrodghāṭaya samaye praveśaya hūṃ

	evam uttaradiksaṃsthaḥ krodhadṛṣṭis tathā paṭhan /
	dvāraṃ dakṣiṇaṃ udghāṭya krodhamudrāṃ vimokṣayet // 44 //

	pūrvadiksaṃsthito yogī pāścimābhimukhas tathā /
	dvāraṃ vāruṇam udghāṭya krodhamudrāṃ vimokṣayet // 45 //

	tathā dakṣiṇadiksaṃsthaḥ pradakṣiṇyena pūrvavat /
	dhanadādhiṣṭhitaṃ dvāram udghāṭyaivaṃ viśet punaḥ // 46 //

puṣpamālāṃ

	oṃ paramasukhāśayasulalitavilāsanamitair namāmi bhagavantaṃ
	jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ hi hi hi hi hīḥ pratīccha kusumāñjariṃ nātha
	hoḥ

iti mantreṇa maṇḍale kṣiptvā punar svaśirasi baddhvā mālābhiṣekāśayena pratyakṣībhūtaṃ cakraṃ ca gurum adhimucya

[p. 22]

tena dīyamānān gṛhītamālābhiṣekādivakṣyamāṇasamastābhiṣekān yathā vidhisarvācāryakarmasv anujñāṃ ca prāpya śiṣyapraveśāya mahāsukhātmakaprajñopāyamayatattvastutipuraḥsarāṃ maṇḍalasiddhim adhilaset satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ ca kuryāt.

	ākāśotpādacihnatvād anādhinidhanaṃ paraḥ /
	mahāvajramayaḥ sattvo 'kṣobhyavajrādya sidhya me // 47 //

	sarvottamamahāsiddhimāhaiśvaryādhidaivataḥ /
	sarvavajradharo rājā sidhya me paramākṣaraḥ // 48 //

	nirdoṣaḥ śāśvataś cāsi sarvarāgānurāgaṇaḥ /
	tattvena sidhya me bhagavan mahārāgo mahārataḥ // 49 //

	atyantaśuddhadharmāgra ādimuktas tathāgataḥ /
	samantabhadraḥ sarvātmā bodhisattvaḥ prasidhya me // 50 //

	sarvottamamahāsiddhimāhaiśvaryāgramudrayā /
	siddhavajramahotkarṣād vajragarvāyate mama // 51 //

	sarvasattvamanovyāpī sarvasattvahṛdi sthitaḥ /
	sarvasattvapitā caiva kāmāgrasamayāgriṇām // 52 //

	yena satyena me jñānaṃ prajñopāyātmamaṇḍalam /
	tena satyena me nātha kāmāṃs tvaṃ paripūraya // 53 //

	pratibimbasamādharmā acchāḥ śuddhā hy anāvilāḥ /
	agrāhyā anabhilāpyāś ca hetukarmasamudbhavāḥ // 54 //

	tathatā tattvaniryātā iti satyena maṇḍalam /
	pratibimbasphuṭaṃ śiṣyāḥ sarve paśyantv akalmaṣāḥ // 55 //

iti paṭhan satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ kuryād ity ācāryapraveśaḥ.



[p. 24]

tataś cādhivāsitaṃ dvisaṃvariṇaṃ śiṣyaṃ pūrvadvāre yavanikāntarite sthāpayitvā sugandhādinā pavitrībhūtaṃ vairocanarūpeṇa cakrādhiparūpeṇa vā ālambitaṃ

	oṃ sarvatathāgatānuttarabodhyalaṃkālavastrapūjāmeghasamudraspharaṇasamaye hūṃ

iti mantreṇa raktāmbaram anyad vā kṛtaparidhānam

	oṃ vajrarakṣa haṃ 

iti kṛtottarīyam

	oṃ vajroṣṇīṣa hūṃ phaṭ 

iti kṛtoṣṇīṣam

	oṃ cakṣurbandhavaram ānaya hūṃ iti mantreṇa baddhāndhapaṭam

	āḥ khaṃ vīra hūṃ

iti gṛhītapuṣpasrajaṃ dattadakṣiṇāṃ sārvakarmikakalaśajalāny utkṣitaṃ yoginyā dhṛtaṃ karmavajriṇā vā.

	tataḥ pṛcchet svaśiṣyaṃ tu kas tvaṃ bhoḥ suratapriyaḥ /
	śiṣyeṇāpi tato vācyaṃ subhago 'haṃ mahāsukhaḥ // 56 //

tatas tasya

	oṃ sarvayogacittam utpādayāmi

iti pāṭhayan bodhicittam utpādya sapuṣpaṃ vajraṃ hṛdi

	oṃ surate samayas tvaṃ hoḥ sidhya vajra yathāsukham

iti paṭhaṃ dhṛtvā

	adya tvaṃ sarvatathāgatādhiṣṭhito bhaviṣyasi.
	na ca tvayedaṃ sarvatathāgataparamarahasyaṃ maṇḍalāpaviṣṭāya vaktavyam na cāśraddhām ity uktvā

	oṃ āḥ yamāntakṛt hūṃ

iti paṭhan ākṛṣya

[p. 26]

	āḥa khaṃ vīra hūṃ

ity anena yavanikābhyantaraṃ praveśya

	mahārata sudṛḍha sutoṣya susukho vajrasattvādya sidhya mām

iti pāṭhena pradakṣiṇayantaṃ kṛtāñjaliṃ maṇḍalasya pūrvadvārībāhuprasārya praṇameta mantram etad udīrayan

	oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjopasthānāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.
	sarvatathāgatavajrasattvādhiṣṭhita mām.

	oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjopasthānāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.
	sarvatathāgatavajravairocanādhitiṣṭha mām.

dakṣiṇe hṛdy añjalinā

	oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjābhiṣekāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.
	sarvatathāgatavajraratnābhiṣiñca mām.

paścime lalāṭāñjalinā

	oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjāpravartanāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.
	sarvatathāgatavajradharma pravartaya mām.

uttare hṛdy añjalinā

	oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjākarmaṇe ātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.
	sarvatathāgatavajrakarma kuru mām.

iti pañcamantrair akṣobhyāditathāgatān praṇamya punaḥ pūrvadvāribāhuprasārya

	oṃ gurucaraṇopasthānāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.

	oṃ sarvasattvaparitrāṇārtham ātmānaṃ niryātayāmi.

ity arthānugamapuraḥsaraṃ pāṭhayet.

[p. 28]

tato 

	adya tvaṃ sarvatathāgatakule praviṣṭas tad ahaṃ te vajrajñānam utpādayāmi yena jñānena tvaṃ sarvatathāgatasiddhīr api prāpsyasi kim utānyāḥ siddhīḥ.
	na ca tvayedam adṛṣṭamaṇḍalasya purato vaktavyaṃ mā te samayo vyathet.

ity uktvā śirasi vajraṃ dhṛtvā ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan

	ayaṃ te samayo vajraṃ mūrdhānaṃ sphoṭayed yadi tvam imaṃ kasyacid brūyāḥ.

ity uktvā punaḥ hṛdi vajraṃ dhṛtvā

	vajrasattvaḥ svayan te 'dya hṛdaye samavasthitaḥ /
	nirbhidya tatkṣaṇaṃ yāyād yadi brūyā imaṃ nayam // 57 //

ity anena śapathaṃ kārayitvā pañcāmṛtaṃ padmabhāṇḍasthaṃ tryakṣaramantritaṃ vijayakalaśoparisthitam

	oṃ vajrāmṛtodaka ṭhaḥ

iti saptajaptam anāmāṅguṣṭhagṛhītabhājanamukhena tasya mukhena dadān

	idaṃ te nārakaṃ vāri samayātikramād dahet /
	samayasaṃrakṣaṇāt siddhiḥ piba vajrāmṛtodakam // 58 //

iti paṭhan koṣapānaṃ kārayitvā

	adyaprabhṛti tavāhaṃ vajrapāṇir yad ahaṃ brūyām idaṃ kuru tat tvayā kartavyam.
	na ca tvayāham avamantavyo mā te viṣamāparihāreṇa kālakriyāṃ kṛtvā narakapatanaṃ syāt.

iti vadet.

iti samayodakadānam.

	ttaś cānuvadet śiṣyaḥ svāveśāya samāhitaḥ /
	sācāryoditāṃ vacāṃ sarvasiddhiprasiddhaye // 59 //

	sarvatathāgatāś cādhitiṣṭhantāṃ vajrasattvo me āviśatv

iti.

tataḥ

	āpādatalamūrdhānaṃ dhyātvā śuṣiradehinam /
	prādādho bhāvayet tasya sānilaṃ vahanimaṇḍalam // 60 //

	tasyopari jhaiḥkāraṃ raktavarṇaṃ vicintayet /
	tadutthair raśminivahaiḥ śarīram śodhayed vratī // 61 //

	evaṃ prabhāsvarīkṛtya vyutthānāyaḥ punaḥ punaḥ kṛtī /
	śiṣyahṛtkaṇṭhaśirasi hūṃ ha āḥ iti vinyasyet // 62 //

	dhṛtvāveśakarīghaṇṭāṃ sāṭopaṃ vādayed vratī /
	tathāgatāveśanārtham imaṃ mantram udīrayet // 63 //

	ayaṃ te samayo vajro vajrasattva iti smṛtaḥ /
	āveśayati te 'dyaiva vajrajñānam uttamam // 64 //

	oṃ vajrāveśa aḥ aḥ aḥ

	yadi nāviśyate caivaṃ paṭhan mantram imaṃ dṛḍham /
	tatas ca āḥkārakiraṇair jñānasattvaṃ pracodayet // 65 //

	āveśaya stobhaya ra ra ra ra cālaya cālaya hūṃ haḥ āḥ jaiḥ

	kṛtakampo romaharṣo vā mūrcchano vāpi nartanam /
	patanañ cordhvataś cāpi vidyād āveśalakṣaṇam // 66 //

	dṛṣṭvā viṣṭarateḥ śiṣyaṃ āḥkāraṃ rasane nyaset /
	śatākṣarair dṛdhīkṛtya pṛcchet śubhāśubhaṃ kṛtī // 67 //

ānīya tad āveśakrameṇānenan mantravit.
avatīrṇadevatāṃ svahṛdraśmibhir ākṛṣya svahṛdbīje 'natarbhāvya śiṣyamūrdhni vajraṃ dhṛtvā

	oṃ kṛto vaḥ

ityādipūrvakam

	hūṃ haḥ āḥ jhaiḥ muḥ

iti visarjayet.

ity āveśavidhi.


[Moriguchi 1990]

1. Vidyābhiṣeka

[1. mālābhiṣeka]

tato maṇḍalābhimukhaṃ śiṣyaṃ cakṣuṣos te kīdṛśo 'vabhāsa iti pṛṣṭvā taduktaiḥ sitapītaraktaśyāmakṛṣṇāvabhāsair yathākramaṃ śāntipuṣṭivaśyābhicārasiddhibhavyatām asya jñātvā,
enam aṅguṣṭhadvaye savajradakṣiṇakareṇa gṛhītvā vajrapadanṛtyābhinayan kuṇḍalimantraṃ paṭhan pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kārayitvā satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ kuryāt.

	ity ayaṃ maṇḍale samyak mayā śiṣyaḥ praveśitaḥ /
	yathā puṇyaṃ tathāsyāstu devatānāṃ kulakramaḥ // 1 //

	yādṛk siddhir bhaved asya gotre yasminś ca bhājane /
	yādṛk puṇyānubhāvaś ca tādṛg asyāstu maṇḍale // 2 //

iti satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ kṛtvā
tataḥ pūrvaṃ gṛhītamālāyāḥ trāṃkāramantritāyā amlānaṃ laghupuṣpaṃ ekam ākṛṣya tatkarapuṭe dadyāt.
sa tadā tatkusumamālām adhimucyātmānaṃ tryakṣareṇojjvalaṃ vigatakalmasam.
guruṇā tathādhiṣṭhito bhaktipuraḥsaraṃ purato 'vasthitam iva samāṇḍaleyaṃ maṇḍaleśam avalambya taṃ maṇḍalaṃ manasā praviśya tacchirasi puṣpaṃ nikṣipet.

	oṃ tiṣṭha vajra dṛḍho me bhava śāśvato me bhava hṛdayaṃ me 'dhitiṣṭha sarvasiddhiṃ me prayaccha hūṃ ha ha ha ha hoḥ āḥ kaṃ vīra hūṃ pratīccha kusumāñjaliṃ nātha hoḥ.

iti mantraṃ paṭhan pañcarekhābhyantarapuṣpapātānurūpato 'sya kulam ādiśet.
tadyogaṃ ca dadyāt siddhiṃ ca lakṣayet.

yadi buddhānāṃ śirasy uṣṇīṣa ūrṇāyāṃ vā patati puṣpaṃ tadā mahāmudrāsiddhiḥ.
locane mukhe vā patati tadā mantrasiddhiḥ.
uttamāṅge uttamā madhyamāṅge madhyamā adhobhāge tv adhamā bimbasyātidūre cirāt samīpe kṣiprasiddhiḥ.
devatānāṃ tu svakīyaṃ sthānaṃ kṣṭhādiṃ vicchedato jñātavyam.
yadi dvayor devatayor antare patati puṣpaṃ tadā yasyāsannaṃ puṣpaṃ tat kulaṃ tasya bhavati.
samatve tūbhayavidhisiddhiḥ.
tadā yatra rucir asya tat kulaṃ tasya bhavati.
pañcarekhābahiḥ pāte punaḥ kṣiped vāratrayaṃ yāvat.
tatra ca bahiḥ pāte kṣudrasiddhiḥ.
bāhyavartularekāsu bāhyavajrāvalībahiḥ pāte nāsti siddhiḥ.
maṇḍalaṃ cāsya na darśayet.
matrajāpādinā bhavyatām āpādya prastāvāntare sa praveśanīyaḥ.
tatas tat puṣpaṃ gṛhītvā tu

	oṃ pratigṛhṇa tvam imaṃ sattva mahābala

iti paṭhan śiṣyaśirasi baddhnīyāt.

iti mālābhiṣekavidhiḥ.

[śiṣyapraveśavidhiḥ]

ihāveśe sati śubhādikathanānantaram

	oṃ tiṣṭha vajra

ity anenāveśaṃ dṛḍhīkṛtya cakṣuravabhāsapraśnādikaṃ śirasi bandhanaparyantaṃ kṛtvāvatīrṇadevatāṃ visarjayet.

[p. 865]

asāmarthyād āveśavidhāv akṛte samayodakadānānantaram eva cakṣuravabhāsapraśnādikaṃ kuryād iti vadanti.

tad anu śiṣyasya netradvaye sajvālam

	oṃ dvayaṃ vibhāvya

	vajrasattvaḥ svayaṃ te 'dya cakṣurudghāṭatatparaḥ /
	udghāṭayati sarvākṣo vajracakṣur anuttaram // 3 //

	oṃ jñānaśakṣuḥ hūṃ aḥ svāhā

iti paṭhann andhapaṭṭam apanayet.
tato

	he vajra paśya

ity uktvā

	idaṃ ca maṇd'laṃ paśya śraddhāṃ janaya vādhunā /
	kule jāto 'si buddhānāṃ mudrāmantrair adhiṣṭhitaḥ // 4 //

	saṃpadā sarvasiddhīnāṃ samayāgryo bhaviṣyasi /
	vajrapadmāgralalitaṃ mantreṣv ārādhanaṃ kuru // 5 //

iti paṭhitvā

	tataḥ prakāśayeet tattvaṃ maṇḍalasya yathākramam /
	devatānāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ svarūpaṃ copadeśayet // 6 //

	satyāryacaturaśraṃ syād brahmavihārakoṇakam /
	dvāraṃ saṃgrahavastvākhyaṃ pratyekaṃ turyasaṃjñakam // 7 //

	śraddhendriyādikaṃ cittaṃ pañcaprākārasaṃbhavam /
	ṛddhipādāś ca catvāro niryūhās te caturvidham // 8 //

	tasya madhye tu yac cakram aṣṭamaṇḍalakopamam /
	vimokṣāṣṭakam etad dhi sarvasiddhiprasādhakam // 9 //

	sarvasiddhimahārāśe stambhabhūtāstu sarvadā /

[p. 863]

	āryāṣṭāṅgikamārgās tv aṣṭastambhā iti smṛtā // 10 //

	dharmadhātvarthasaṃketaṃ cakrābhyantaramaṇḍalam /
	cittamaṇḍalam etad dhi mahāmokṣapuraṃ varam // 11 //

	dhyānāni toraṇāny eha patākā prakṛtis tathā /
	saṃbodheḥ phalabhūtāni dvāreṣu kalpapādapāḥ // 12 //

	pañcaskandhasvabhāvena pañcabuddhān pradarśayet /
	locanādicaturdevīḥ pṛthivyādisvabhāvikāḥ /
	pañcakāmasvabhāvena rūpavajrādikās tathā // 13 //

	cakṣurādisvabhāvena kṣitigarbhādikān punaḥ /
	bhujādirūpān krodhendrān yamāryādīn pradarśayet // 14 //

	kāyacakragatān buddhān akṣobhyādīn yathākramam /
	bāhyacakre tu śiṣyāya prakāśayet kṛpātmakam // 15 //

iti.

	vajramaṇḍalamahāmaṇḍalapraviṣṭho 'ham.
	yogamaṇḍalamahāmaṇḍaladarśito 'ham. 
	guhyamaṇḍalamahāmaṇḍaladīkṣito 'ham.

iti pāṭhayitvā samayaṃ śrāvayet.

	hoḥ hoḥ hoḥ.

iti śiṣyapraveśavidhiḥ.

[2. udakābhiṣekavidhi]

tad anūdakābhiṣekārthaṃ yathāvibhavaṃ gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā pṛthivyām āropitajānuḥ kṛtāñjaliḥ.

	bodhivajreṇa buddhānāṃ yathā datto mahāmahaḥ /
	mamāpi trāṇārthāya khavajrādyaṃ dadāhi me // 16 //

iti paṭhann adhyeṣayet.

[p. 861]

	tato maṇḍalabāhye tu pūrvasyāṃ diśi maṇḍalam /
	aiśānyāṃ vā likhen mantrī caturasraṃ caturmukham // 17 //

	dvihastaṃ dvipuṭaṃ caiva tanmadhye viśvapaṅkajam /
	svetair raktais tathā krṣṇaiḥ prākāratritayaṃ likhet // 18 //

	cakraṃ pūrve yame ratnaṃ paścime 'bjaṃ sakeśaram /
	dhanadaviśvavajraṃ ca saṃsthāpya kalaśān nyaset // 19 //

iti snānamaṇḍalavidhiḥ.

	kṛtamālābhiṣekaṃ taṃ śiṣyam ānīya maṇḍalam /
	madhye padmasya saṃsthāpya devatāgarbhadhāriṇam // 20 //

	ācāryaḥ sagaṇaḥ kuryād vajraśiṣyāya secanam /
	kalaśair uddhṛtair gāthāḥ paṭhan maṅgalapūrvikāḥ // 21 //

	sitaśimbikavatpūrṇā jināḥ kalaśadhāriṇaḥ /
	adya tvām abhiṣiñcanti jñātvaivaṃ sumanābhāvam // 22 //

ity uktvā śiṣyaṃ bhāvitavajradhararūpaṃ prāguktena vidhinā nīrājayet.

tad anu hṛdbījamayūkhair anantadigvartinas tathāgatān vidyādevīś cākṛṣya saṃpūjya śiṣyābhiṣekārthaṃ

	buddhānām abhiṣekas tu jagattrāṇāya vajriṇā /
	yathā dattas tathā dadadhvam asya hi // 23 //

iti gāthayā prārthya tais tathāgataiḥ prajñāsamāpannair mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya vairocanadvāreṇāntarniviśya vajramārgeṇa (p.859-->)